sequenceDiagram
  actor Browser
  participant Edge as Cloudflare Edge
  participant App as Worker SSR
  participant Host as Host Resolver
  participant DB as D1 Public Snapshots
  participant R2 as R2 Assets
  Browser->>Edge: GET https://customer-event.com/programacao
  Edge->>App: request with original trusted host
  App->>Host: canonical hostname -> tenant+destination
  Host->>DB: check active mapping and publication pointer
  DB-->>Host: org/event/edition + snapshot revision
  Host-->>App: read-only publication context
  App->>DB: fetch public snapshot (tenant scoped)
  App->>R2: get referenced published public image metadata
  App-->>Edge: SSR HTML canonical+no private data
  Edge-->>Browser: response host-specific caching
  Note over Edge,App: Cache key must include host, edition, revision
  Note over DB,R2: Draft/private assets never served publicly
